      "comment": "Avrelian: Reed Miller (the name)",
      "content": "Reed Miller was an alias used by at least three people: Avrelian, then Alia, then Brahe, plus many later pretenders. In Nod-Krai folklore the name is revered, and most cheap novels about the master thief tell Alia's or Brahe's tales or are pure fiction.",
