        "Great Treasure"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Reed Miller"
      ],
      "comment": "Avrelian: Great Treasure and the Proofs of the Cognoscenti",
      "content": "In legend, Reed Miller left a great treasure \"East of the Moon, West of the Sun\". Brahe, the third Reed Miller, created the story and the five Proofs of the Cognoscenti (including a rusted flower and a black feather) to keep treasure hunters hooked, as the quest The Raven's Legacy shows. The hoard turned out to be a mountain of Iron Coins.",
