    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Ruler of Elysium",
        "King of Elysium",
        "prophesied Ruler"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Avrelian",
        "Rotwang"
      ],
      "comment": "Avrelian: Ruler of Elysium prophecy",
      "content": "The Frostmoon Scions' millennia-long plan was for a pure-blooded maiden to bear a sacred heir destined to reign over Elysium; item text calls Avrelian that prophesied son, who rejected the crowns fate ordained. Rotwang told him both were chosen by fate, urging him to cast aside his melancholy and follow, and Avrelian's last words to Alia say \"If I am indeed the prophesied Ruler of Elysium\". Alia later accuses Rotwang of spinning every promise and lie to make him seize the Sampo Mill.",
